    "en": {
      "name": "Ars Magna of Unification and Separation",
      "effect": "You can banish this card from your hand; Special Summon 1 non-Spellcaster \"Ars Magna\" monster from your GY or banishment, also your \"Power Patron\" Link Monsters can make up to 3 attacks on monsters during each Battle Phase this turn. If a Synchro and/or Link Monster(s) is Special Summoned while this card is banished (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card. You can banish 1 \"Ars Magna\" card from your GY; draw 1 card. You can only use each effect of \"Ars Magna of Unification and Separation\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
